@startuml Sequence: Undo / Redo
participant MainWindow
participant AppController
participant CommandHistory
participant Command
participant Circuit

MainWindow -> AppController : undo()
AppController -> CommandHistory : undo()
CommandHistory -> Command : undo()
Command -> Circuit : restore previous state
CommandHistory --> AppController
AppController --> MainWindow
MainWindow -> CircuitScene : sync_scene()

== Redo ==
MainWindow -> AppController : redo()
AppController -> CommandHistory : redo()
CommandHistory -> Command : execute()
Command -> Circuit : apply state
CommandHistory --> AppController
AppController --> MainWindow
MainWindow -> CircuitScene : sync_scene()
@enduml